# Namleh Artifact Governor

Use this when an artifact matters after the current chat.

## Classify First

| Class | Examples | Default Home |
| --- | --- | --- |
| local-only | scratch notes, private debug logs | `.gstack-namleh/` |
| repo evidence | QA report, release checklist | repo docs or PR comment |
| shared internal | retros, model benchmarks, security reports | future Ops knowledge object or private artifact repo |
| client/partner visible | delivery PDF, external spec | approved docs area with access control |
| secret-bearing | logs with tokens, raw env dumps | do not store; redact or rotate |

## Rules

- Secret-scan before committing or sharing.
- Screenshots may contain private data; treat them as internal unless proven
  otherwise.
- Prefer PR/issue comments for review-time evidence.
- Prefer repo docs for durable technical docs.
- Prefer Ops Platform storage once access controls exist.

